-- test: a field of the reply `handle` returns is `internal`, so a `secret` value in it is U4001, as in every constructor of `Reply` (spec/31 §7, ADR 0123 rules 1 and 16)
-- spec: spec/31 §7
-- expect: error U4001 at src/srv.una:10:22
module srv

import std.host (Reply, Request)

--- Answers with a secret, which the reply cannot carry.
pub handle(request: internal Request, token: secret Text) -> internal Reply = Reply(status: 200,
  headers: [], body: token
)
